s 121. The reference_virtual_android and reference_virtual_pc folders contain emulated Android and Windows trajectories without privacy labels as reference material outside the evaluation. The card is an anonymous-review version without a citation; the paper link comes from the project page that the paper's abstract links. Screenshots contain personal information, and the card limits use to research.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Futuresis/GUIGuard-page/df9c709058d7e39d1f9286edd33c9f645aa60b55/index.html","target_id":"arxiv:2601.18842","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Public-ladder release of GUIGuard-Bench: 121 Android and Linux desktop agent trajectories whose 2,002 screenshots carry region-level privacy labels, for privacy recognition, protected-screen planning and click grounding.","task_classes":["R01.05.01.01","R03.08.01.01"],"topics":["safety-security","evaluation","grounding","screen-understanding"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/ShaofantuoshuzhengzhiSha/GUIGuard-Bench"}
